#: scenario5:scenario5_4192DE52_71D2_4CD7_A2B6_2560383B81C3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4bbf71e9cf2cc826d830816c062ffc4b28c89856fcab9c5dffa2e748a7777371
#. default-sha256: 3221e8345467f0fecca4bc9eafc13698392f7c5c89dc0f752b981f9f05ff99cb
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_4192DE52_71D2_4CD7_A2B6_2560383B81C3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫I didn’t really "
"understand Michel."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫내 안에서 ⟪k:15⟫미"
"셸은 ⟪k:16⟫종잡기 힘든 사람이었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_2175D33D_9FEE_4962_9030_ACDA650195EF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 46aa3e468365310698f7d0c2db2146fa9b38f0e8cd7e7f192bd973d5d8a2e051
#. default-sha256: 8e044e1e9b215d64f918447460361c64269764e505d89773cbfb367d5980a2ff
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_2175D33D_9FEE_4962_9030_ACDA650195EF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But that was probably because we were still essentially strangers."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하지만 ⟪k:1⟫그건 아직 ⟪k:2⟫서로를 잘 몰라서 그럴 것이다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_B9E5076F_86BC_4FCD_8795_13236C3198BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a44a4e482ea0e2af42bfac6eaf21d3593ec8fbdd9d8430925e06f6bf05d3aaa0
#. default-sha256: 259bcd11d7edcb6b2bc63e69130c8de57e281ae153fa5401420319e39913b2a4
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B9E5076F_86BC_4FCD_8795_13236C3198BD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Having been sent to the mansion as reparation for my mistakes,⟪k:1⟫I wasn’t sure who I might "
"find there,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫나는 “죄”의 대가로 이 저택에 온 입장이다. ⟪k:1⟫그래서 ⟪k:2⟫저택에 어떤 사람이 있을지 걱정스러"
"웠는데……."

#: scenario5:scenario5_1A3ED3E4_ACAB_4EEC_A286_785C54D46722
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 95744b05f8a6878d1ca477446276fb7907af7e6f3bfb4e80be3ffc84c8ed1263
#. default-sha256: 49f22770310b64817def285ff50c798120e9849790a7c512b7ca2bd10df3c36e
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1A3ED3E4_ACAB_4EEC_A286_785C54D46722"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫but I was tentatively convinced he wasn’t a ⟪k:1⟫terrible⟪k:2⟫ person.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫He didn’t do "
"anything to me—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫except stay away."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫당장은 ⟪k:1⟫미셸이 몹쓸 사람 같진 않았다. ⟪k:2⟫내게 간섭하지 않고, ⟪k:3⟫그냥 ⟪k:4⟫거리만 둘 "
"뿐이었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_1A399BDC_0574_4BE2_B2F0_3315DDB85EE2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 39ec9f569ef652bce985183453e4776d88e3b3527f3cfeb900d5ec0df751a6e9
#. default-sha256: d9e3d7c5ffab0e719e4060310b05e2b56fa8a99507a5fb78bd38b4943cfa11b1
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1A399BDC_0574_4BE2_B2F0_3315DDB85EE2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Michel spent most of his time in his chambers,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫미셸은 대부분의 시간을 본인 방에서 보내는 모양이었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_6AD7B8F3_2F9A_4C61_9642_13D41D84E7C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1718072c37bfd79a599e7d45fba60ec8952c713d8b349df3d5cc5062335e6636
#. default-sha256: d48f1576826678e7a55bf2eabcbfe69a6a49fb1d65097b2757a2ca2471b9079b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_6AD7B8F3_2F9A_4C61_9642_13D41D84E7C8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫which he had told me to never enter under any circumstances,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그 방에는 ⟪k:1⟫결코 들어오지 말란 엄포를 들었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_837EFFAC_46B5_46CA_90AC_C53143E2947A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: afa8f17c240e25c7d21d4cf03e6a2065a0f68ea19b2c40ee7e82028e3452bd60
#. default-sha256: 172d2d98e1c9f79732a878e377ff56210a00f145647c5810d7a10ba07ff3f617
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_837EFFAC_46B5_46CA_90AC_C53143E2947A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫so we rarely encountered one another in the halls."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그래서 저택 안에 같이 살지만, 만나는 경우가 드물었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_5C61B705_A21D_410F_B346_EB157082420C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 19b54728820495188e1f6b353bbb4ac6c762e460f64ab3eb5f4c4640c93d0f6e
#. default-sha256: bebebf40c22fd081d47d27627a2e27fca998271a7cc11a2c94d07433f1d5a337
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5C61B705_A21D_410F_B346_EB157082420C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫For that reason, I made an effort to be kind and cheerful on the sporadic occasions we ⟪k:1⟫"
"did⟪k:2⟫ cross paths."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하지만 ⟪k:1⟫그렇기에―― 가끔 만날 때나마, ⟪k:2⟫밝게 접하려고 했다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_DD88F4CD_6D98_4C70_B736_FA324FDB6E3E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b6125f7c5284c2f7c39485985bb1c4f118efb9affa28fdec7f395ba4a2700e0b
#. default-sha256: da82b02f27c6f71f1e9647abf3faf635b0f82e33eb1ce809bec58c776fe2820e
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_DD88F4CD_6D98_4C70_B736_FA324FDB6E3E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I figured if I kept that up long enough,⟪k:1⟫he would eventually warm up to me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그러다 보면―― ⟪k:1⟫미셸이 마음을 열어 줄 수도 있다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_9C8A8B5A_8305_40B6_B42D_DE03C5F8F9BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bea1807c0c151c31ddfc7e42b96a22eb45118acc021e1e4c0a25d96866e1d7b2
#. default-sha256: 7e22499fb483f23463bfc914125195db83adae008a67a786afda3eaf09e95ed8
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9C8A8B5A_8305_40B6_B42D_DE03C5F8F9BC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And as new housemates, being able to enjoy our time together was obviously preferable to the "
"alternative."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫기왕 같은 곳에서 사는 것이니 ⟪k:1⟫즐겁게 지내는 게 훨씬 낫다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_9C8A8B5A_8305_40B6_B42D_DE03C6F8F9BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 43da34e0c21a8965328120e9deceda51f3722ba644e0b69f57fdb6678eb5978a
#. default-sha256: 660de038f7d1d5ac120a0c58411a38f541175f664a8c8cf42359f5d09693f341
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9C8A8B5A_8305_40B6_B42D_DE03C6F8F9BC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If I did manage to break the ice, I hoped we would be able to do some talking—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫"
"about the mansion, about him, about me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫마음을 열어 주면…… ⟪k:1⟫많은 이야기를 나눌 수 있을 것이다. ⟪k:2⟫이 저택 이야기나 ⟪k:3⟫미셸 본"
"인의 이야기, ⟪k:4⟫내 이야기 등."

#: scenario5:scenario5_9C8A8B5A_8305_40B6_B42D_DE23C5F8F9BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1b7d1bec4a81a2f16512354a12bea68f8ce11dbbdd456027277595fcfe716eb0
#. default-sha256: e7550765c9a329e1ef23ec7e2f4fc0f0f5e5c839a980d66c0aa20dbb5bcdd084
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9C8A8B5A_8305_40B6_B42D_DE23C5F8F9BC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I just had to keep working at it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그때까지 노력해 보고자―― 마음먹었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_94B28477_ABF4_482D_9AC5_C312F87772BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 779ff40db20b77707be7a12d4e6ad17f9af9cf760c6036288c12a50db9d0ca37
#. default-sha256: 544a4468f2fae8c442de707718bf918690b9e4fe698d062a8916394187e8b4e4
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_94B28477_ABF4_482D_9AC5_C312F87772BC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Michel didn’t need me to take care of him.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫He handled his own day-to-day needs "
"and activities by himself,⟪k:4⟫and in fact, he didn’t ask me for anything."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫수발을 들 필요는 ⟪k:2⟫없었다. ⟪k:3⟫미셸은 애초에 나를 의지하지 않아서 ⟪k:4⟫자기 일은 다 "
"알아서 처리했다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_2CB58756_5E47_4229_A0F4_2057BBBB5DC5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 92f47e0a236dc5e7dc2f16a970e5702b2e65ef3f6a4765b037624a5f20866404
#. default-sha256: 530bc9911c223853ebb8d4b18ec8327092db5bdb74605c7af4edbd7adb5b2243
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_2CB58756_5E47_4229_A0F4_2057BBBB5DC5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫An aristocrat who had no use for his servant—⟪k:1⟫I hadn’t met anyone like him before."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫고용인을 부리지 않는 귀족. ⟪k:1⟫그런 사람은 ⟪k:2⟫처음 만난 것 같다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_08503938_3750_4B42_AD57_9D4057420069
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cebac079a8693955efd175635e1e37aefe22f2ad44e9bf11994e5b6ef44299c8
#. default-sha256: c69396fbf97cc26527662cb9ce17fce662b1be6c221a897134f98d8fe9b87e88
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_08503938_3750_4B42_AD57_9D4057420069"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫All right, then."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫………좋았어."

#: scenario5:scenario5_22229AC0_62EC_4C47_BBB6_981E435ED90D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dcd5ead8406105415d619ef2754cc891045e8ada35435bf1df7f477ec3cc6621
#. default-sha256: 2c9fb1c056cc1dc15175ecd5dacd438529708f72f4740f7c1ce89f7f8419add8
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_22229AC0_62EC_4C47_BBB6_981E435ED90D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That meant about all I could do was clean."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그래서 ⟪k:1⟫가능한 거라곤 ⟪k:2⟫방 청소 정도였다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_EBDE2311_051B_4F20_8957_58F329E531C0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 86384cca902c1e80f121b11edf89e63105f0027b6903e7f486e766a18ae8e326
#. default-sha256: 99321b9a2de8354d83f3005754c256bd74f378f9f188efb8ddf70c23ebff164b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_EBDE2311_051B_4F20_8957_58F329E531C0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I wasn’t sure how his room looked,⟪k:1⟫but the rest of the house was, quite frankly,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫미셸의 방이 어떤 상태인진 몰라도, ⟪k:1⟫다른 방들은 ⟪k:2⟫솔직히……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_28A590F8_3E65_4CBA_9BB6_6B6A1F40E6F7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: edca8337f4922ff62a6a349bf70d5cf2819037d40a287742b4daa3674ef9eff4
#. default-sha256: 216ebbcb87a0a0313751ceb06fee873285064ccb850ae231f40b58418e0f4d43
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_28A590F8_3E65_4CBA_9BB6_6B6A1F40E6F7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫an absolute disaster."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫꼴이 말이 아니었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_9ABE020C_6F10_4175_8CBE_9513F1C4460F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6ec0b4470b3ff0e8b5b5c640e0331c16bf595e1af2f8916d1c5b079a5a0aa52c
#. default-sha256: 3b7e1e21c3dd64d3a46cbcbfd52d867c09c82a0d54fdc88079df6b6c7fb68ce1
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9ABE020C_6F10_4175_8CBE_9513F1C4460F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The dust was so heavy it was obvious it hadn’t been touched in years."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫몇 년이나 청소를 안 한 건가 ⟪k:1⟫싶을 만큼 ⟪k:2⟫먼지가 쌓여 있었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_70932162_D4E5_48C0_AA9E_46305E93B326
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a7198e8a66676c33b14be898da1fe28b0bfeed6360aecaff4ea212806b026a90
#. default-sha256: 6020896445762f757b0bbe7fe10aded6389a502f0770b2af1b11213a2a6b7ffb
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_70932162_D4E5_48C0_AA9E_46305E93B326"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Let’s get started!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫해 보자……!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_7F83E47E_F419_4757_9041_BA63BE0ED8E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 53c0837356529f7d04390b868dedae67f7db7d14a4211cb09eef795373ce2f55
#. default-sha256: 5528f6dcbd9ac86e6633cc587daf77896641123c419b35023185422ef117cd30
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7F83E47E_F419_4757_9041_BA63BE0ED8E3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It couldn’t be healthy to live in these conditions, so I set out to clean each room in the "
"house one by one."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫환경이 이러면 ⟪k:1⟫위생적으로도 해롭다. ⟪k:2⟫나는 저택 방들을 ⟪k:3⟫차례대로 청소하기로 했다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_96BE2FEC_54AA_46B0_989A_AF2BB4AAAA82
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b6c3cc1df36f2e3e369e441bc9b9350877bf42445e2c18ce7efe418ad7251596
#. default-sha256: 9546cff5f15fbb30e38dbc18876e567f8d40fce4c881a22d101e71061429411b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_96BE2FEC_54AA_46B0_989A_AF2BB4AAAA82"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That said, it wasn’t going to be an easy task."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하지만 그건 ⟪k:1⟫꽤 힘든 작업이었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_903B6B3D_F1A4_4D9A_8915_EDFF16189AFC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ebee76699058499f12800f9d5b14e679c2c9f4cbeb6127ebb38d868a7e6b10b8
#. default-sha256: 083c22fc93554c15c6686e4c032e7a66a5499bd0a0e403fa38e3a9508a5424c7
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_903B6B3D_F1A4_4D9A_8915_EDFF16189AFC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Not because I was bad at cleaning—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫in fact, I considered myself quite good at it—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그 이유는 내가 결코 청소를 못 해서 그런 게 아니라――⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫오히려 ⟪k:3⟫잘하는 축에 들지만――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_6EED7906_7A20_4A87_9380_7D61E457C41A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fce34e6a0e93f52facb6c3ee2194b24c627228076b5979649a5e5d78bb649eaa
#. default-sha256: a300ca5ebc2e16e7bb4ea08675a53a9235f1075870c1a4fd0aa0e2e0543b00c4
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_6EED7906_7A20_4A87_9380_7D61E457C41A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫but because it was near impossible to find all the dust and grime that needed cleaning under "
"the flickering light of a candle."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫불빛이라곤 촛대 위에서 일렁이는 촛불 정도이기에, ⟪k:1⟫구석까지 깔끔하게 청소하는 게 ⟪k:2⟫고역"
"이라 그렇다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_B410BE8E_78D9_44E6_BB98_E6A927B785DA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1b5e4c5f43706b9f6523b6234317c5435df506bd13bb1e7dd40af77529642008
#. default-sha256: 56d5bc98615b68aa335a413b3f30a6a893f0e0894ad4760ec20697429d7cc751
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B410BE8E_78D9_44E6_BB98_E6A927B785DA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I can’t understand how anyone sane can live in this dark.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫What’s wrong with him?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫애초에 ⟪k:1⟫이렇게 캄캄한 곳에서 생활하는 게 제정신이 아니지. ⟪k:2⟫무슨 의도인 걸까……."

#: scenario5:scenario5_356CFF91_0BC9_440F_B59D_17FAB597849E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
